.TH ALIENS-INVADERS 6 "25-SEP-2026" "@VERSION@" "Aliens Invaders Manual"
.SH NAME
aliens-invaders \- Modern arcade vertical space shooter powered by C++20 and SDL3
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aliens-invaders
[\fB\-driver\fR \fIDRIVER\fR]
[\fB\-drivers\fR]
[\fB\-playlist\fR]
[\fB\-play\fR \fITRACK\fR]
[\fB\-play\fR \fIFIRST\fR \fILAST\fR]
[\fB\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Aliens Invaders
is an arcade vertical-scrolling space combat game engineered natively for
.B Wayland
and modern platforms using
.BR SDL3 " and " C++20 .
.PP
The engine features a modern Vulkan graphics pipeline with automatic OpenGL fallback, deterministic fixed-step 60 Hz simulation physics, tear-free subpixel render interpolation (alpha) up to 360+ Hz, procedural physical stereo 2.1 sound synthesis, non-repeating stage bonus economy (maximum 5 unique power-ups per 15-wave stage), compile-time embedded assets, non-blocking asynchronous persistence, fair-play anti-scissor trajectory calculations, and resolution-segregated local Hall of Fame leaderboards.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-driver " \fIDRIVER\fR, " \-\-driver " \fIDRIVER\fR, " \-d " \fIDRIVER\fR"
Launch the game using a specific 2D graphics rendering driver (e.g. \fBvulkan\fR, \fBopengl\fR, \fBopengles2\fR, or \fBsoftware\fR).
.TP
.BR \-drivers ", " \-\-drivers ", " \-list\-drivers
Display all available 2D graphics rendering drivers compiled into SDL3 on this display, then exit immediately.
.TP
.BR \-playlist ", " \-\-playlist ", " \-l
Display the complete 15-track classical symphonic soundtrack anthology with composer biographies, opus catalogs, and historical curiosities, then exit immediately without launching the graphical display.
.TP
.BR \-play " \fITRACK\fR, " \-\-play " \fITRACK\fR"
Play a single soundtrack movement (1 to 15) in headless terminal mode. Features live ASCII progress feedback.
.TP
.BR \-play " \fIFIRST\fR \fILAST\fR, " \-\-play " \fIFIRST\fR \fILAST\fR"
Play a sequential range of movements from \fIFIRST\fR through \fILAST\fR inclusive (1 to 15, with \fILAST\fR >= \fIFIRST\fR). Press \fBCtrl+C\fR at any time to gracefully halt playback.
.TP
.BR \-help ", " \-\-help ", " \-h
Print command-line reference and usage options to standard output.
.SH IN-GAME CONTROLS
.TP
.B Keyboard & Gamepad Mappings:
.TP
.BI Space " / " Gamepad\ A " / " RT
Fire primary plasma cannons.
.TP
.BI Left\ / \ Right\ Arrow " / " Left\ Analog " / " D-Pad
Maneuver starship horizontally across the evasive baseline.
.TP
.BI t " / " Gamepad\ Y
Toggle ship model between \fBThe Cruiser\fR (standard tactical workhorse) and \fBThe Vanguard\fR (skunkworks high-G apex interceptor).
.TP
.BI f
Toggle Fullscreen mode (supports native 4K UHD resolutions).
.TP
.BI 1,\ 2,\ 3
Preset resolution scales: 1280x720, 1600x900, 1920x1080.
.TP
.BI -\ / \ + " / " LB\ / \ RB
Adjust particle density (0 OFF to 4 MAX).
.TP
.BI LT\ / \ RT
Cycle menu documentation and briefing pages left / right.
.TP
.BI i\ / \ b " / " Gamepad\ B
Toggle hardware telemetry OSD overlay (CPU%, RAM%, FPS, SDL driver).
.TP
.BI h " / " Gamepad\ Back
Cycle Hall of Fame displays (per-resolution, global legends, dossiers).
.TP
.BI p " / " Gamepad\ Start
Pause / Resume active combat.
.TP
.BI s " / " Gamepad\ Start
Start a new game from the menu.
.TP
.BI c
Cheat mode (instantly grants full firepower; disables leaderboard saving).
.TP
.BI q
Quit current match or exit to desktop.
.SH SOUNDTRACK
The procedural audio engine synthesizes authentic 5-instrument classical quintet arrangements in RAM without audio files (Violin, Cello, Flute, Trumpet, and Concert Grand Piano). Featured works include Beethoven (Symphony No. 9 in D minor), Carlos Gomes (Il Guarany Overture), Puccini (Nessun Dorma), Tchaikovsky (Swan Lake, Piano Concerto No. 1), Dvorak (New World Symphony), Bach (Air on the G String), Ravel (Bolero), Rossini (The Barber of Seville), Grieg (Peer Gynt), Zequinha de Abreu (Tico-Tico no Fuba), Holst (Jupiter), Chopin (Nocturne Op. 9 No. 2), Debussy (Clair de Lune), and Vivaldi (The Four Seasons: Spring).
.SH AUTHORS
.B Claudio Fernandes de Souza Rodrigues
(Lead Engine Architecture, C++20 Systems, Procedural 2.1 Audio, Aerodynamics & Gameplay).
